1
00:00:02,180 --> 00:00:05,100
=The Truth (Season 4)=
(Behind-the-Scenes Cast Interview)

2
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,190
(Wu Bi as Mr. Wu)
While waiting backstage,

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,990
(Pai Xiaoxuan as Pai)
which player stood out as being

4
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:08,710
quiet or outgoing?

5
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:09,870
I heard Ding singing

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,620
"Love Overcomes Everything"
downstairs yesterday.

7
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,590
(I was indeed singing)
So I thought he must

8
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:15,990
be quite outgoing.

9
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,590
They also seem very close
to one another,

10
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,190
so I do not think any of them
are particularly quiet.

11
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,270
(Quite perceptive)
They are all very outgoing.

12
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:21,990
Yes.

13
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,510
What about you, Mr. Wu?

14
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,590
(The butler is exasperated)
They are simply so loud.

15
00:00:25,600 --> 00:00:26,310
(Joining the group immediately)
Not noisy.

16
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,350
Just very lively.

17
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:28,070
What's it to you?

18
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:29,470
(Don't forget your identity)
We're an prestigious family.

19
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:30,080
Exactly.

20
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:30,910
Are we not all...

21
00:00:30,920 --> 00:00:32,310
(Desperately trying to save face)
None of us are related by blood.

22
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,510
We are an elite family.

23
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:34,830
They're so loud

24
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:35,590
I can't hear

25
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,550
my earpiece.

26
00:00:37,560 --> 00:00:38,910
(Worried about all the heirs)
Will the helicopter fit us all?

27
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,830
It will.

28
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:40,830
Two can hang outside.

29
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:42,350
Okay.

30
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,230
We could lower

31
00:00:43,240 --> 00:00:44,390
the ladder

32
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,470
(Watching silently)
and stand on it.

33
00:00:45,480 --> 00:00:46,790
Ning could hang outside like this.

34
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:49,140
Very lively indeed.

35
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:51,550
Did you deliberately set up jokes
for the players during filming?

36
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,510
How did they react?

37
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:54,390
I feel that some romantic scenes

38
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,270
may have been incorporated
into the script.

39
00:00:56,960 --> 00:00:58,070
Ding.

40
00:00:58,940 --> 00:00:59,980
(Huh?)

41
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:07,070
What's with the car?

42
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,350
There is absolutely nothing between us.

43
00:01:08,820 --> 00:01:10,180
(That was a close one!)

44
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:13,150
He has never given me
any high-fashion dresses.

45
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:15,910
What?

46
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:19,620
(What a bold one)

47
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:21,110
Nor has he ever

48
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:22,550
personally written his name on my arm.

49
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,030
His name.

50
00:01:24,030 --> 00:01:24,700
(Ding)

51
00:01:24,760 --> 00:01:26,430
What?

52
00:01:26,540 --> 00:01:27,860
(That was explosive)

53
00:01:27,900 --> 00:01:32,220
(His name)

54
00:01:32,220 --> 00:01:32,980
(The next part is even more explosive)

55
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,990
Sir, I am sorry.

56
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:35,830
But what am I to do?

57
00:01:35,840 --> 00:01:37,590
As a capable maid,

58
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:39,190
my body can carry sacks of rice

59
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,470
and tanks of gas,

60
00:01:40,480 --> 00:01:42,590
but it cannot withstand
the way my heart aches for you.

61
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:47,430
He is firing straight into my heart.

62
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:49,190
How is the situation
concerning Uncle Er?

63
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:51,590
We're investigating.
There's a new development.

64
00:01:52,040 --> 00:01:54,030
All right. I am putting her to sleep.

65
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,990
I will come find you once she is asleep.

66
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:59,990
What if she discovers our relationship?

67
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,870
Do not worry.
I can handle her completely.

68
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:04,990
So, earlier,

69
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:06,390
the investigators asked me

70
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:09,670
that if I had to choose
between the two young masters,

71
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:13,030
which one I might prefer.

72
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:17,190
Between He and Ding,

73
00:02:17,200 --> 00:02:19,830
which one is truly your beloved?

74
00:02:21,400 --> 00:02:22,470
I have to choose one?

75
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:25,390
As an adult, I refuse to choose.

76
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:26,110
I want them both.

77
00:02:26,110 --> 00:02:27,100
(They are all beloved)

78
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:28,470
I deeply

79
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:30,070
regret that answer now.

80
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:32,190
I do not know if I am allowed
to say this,

81
00:02:32,200 --> 00:02:33,710
but privately, I actually
prefer Zhou Keyu.

82
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:35,160
(An Ke, Fifth Young Master of An family)

83
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:37,590
Could this be the legendary
dream,Uncle Ke?

84
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:39,430
So at the time, I said,

85
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,790
"As an adult, I refuse to choose".

86
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,670
"I want them both".

87
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:42,710
But once I came downstairs,

88
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,790
I wondered, why did I not say
I wanted Mr. Ke?

89
00:02:44,790 --> 00:02:45,500
(Completely devoted to Mr. Ke)

90
00:02:45,880 --> 00:02:47,630
I regretted it the moment
I came downstairs.

91
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:49,070
Did you incorporate your comedic

92
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:50,670
skills into today's performance?

93
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:51,150
Skills?

94
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:52,950
The skill was essentially

95
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:54,110
to keep thinking of jokes in case

96
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:55,630
they asked me some difficult questions.

97
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:57,470
I was afraid it'd get awkwardly quiet.

98
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:59,870
Yes, it probably helped a little.

99
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,030
How was being an NPC

100
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:02,950
on a variety show different

101
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,870
from your previous work?

102
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,390
Theater is fully rehearsed

103
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,470
before being performed on stage.

104
00:03:06,480 --> 00:03:07,910
During rehearsals, however,

105
00:03:07,920 --> 00:03:09,070
you have more freedom

106
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:10,350
to move around and more control

107
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,990
over the environment.

108
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,190
What about you, Pai?

109
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:15,430
I suppose I had to stay
a little more focused.

110
00:03:15,880 --> 00:03:17,110
Over the past few days,

111
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:18,470
I've been thinking about my role.

112
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:19,830
(Well prepared)
I was worried

113
00:03:19,840 --> 00:03:20,710
that when the players

114
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,430
questioned me, I might not
know how to respond

115
00:03:22,440 --> 00:03:23,430
or might disrupt

116
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:25,070
the atmosphere

117
00:03:25,080 --> 00:03:26,390
and compromise my character.

118
00:03:26,400 --> 00:03:28,470
(Fully committed to the role)
So I had to stay more focused.

119
00:03:28,480 --> 00:03:30,430
When I normally film my own content,

120
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:31,390
because it is my own work,

121
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,070
I am comfortable

122
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,190
with it and do not feel

123
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,710
nearly as much pressure.

124
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:36,000
(He Jinghao as Cameraman He)

125
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:37,510
Did the players ever make you
break character?

126
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,590
It happened at the end,

127
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:41,790
when Ms. Jin said, "Why don't
we silence them permanently?"

128
00:03:41,790 --> 00:03:42,520
(That was terrifying)

129
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,310
So I immediately ran away.

130
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:46,150
Which player would you most
like to exchange identities with?

131
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,150
Ms. Jin.

132
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:50,350
Why?

133
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:52,630
Because she is very entertaining.

134
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:53,550
(Of course)
She's very good at the game.

135
00:03:56,060 --> 00:03:57,260
=The Truth (Season 4)=

136
00:03:57,260 --> 00:03:58,380
(SVIP: New episodes Wed & Thu at 12 PM)

137
00:03:58,380 --> 00:03:59,340
